  <h1>How Much Light Does Lettuce Need Indoors? The Number I Got Wrong Twice</h1>
</article>
<figure class="hero">
  <img src="/images/hero-how-much-light-does-lettuce-need.jpg" alt="A compact head of green lettuce under a slim LED grow light bar on a kitchen shelf" loading="eager" width="1344" height="768" />
